   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "If able to, retract foreskin, wash with water, dry and examine: • If ulcer/s present 65. • If glans inflamed, treat for balanitis/balanoposthitis (BAL): - Advise to retract and wash daily with water, avoid soap. Dry fully. - Give clotrimazole cream 12 hourly for 7 days. - Check urine dipstick for glucose. If glucose present, refer. - Offer referral for medical male circumcision. - Advise to return if no better in 7 days:",
   "bbox": [
    555.7,
    421.9,
    801.9,
    502.1
   ],
   "key": "p63-e71a108c"
  },
  {
