   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Treat for scrotal swelling (SSW): • Give single dose ceftriaxone 250mg IM1 and single dose azithromycin 1g. • If severe penicillin allergy2, omit ceftriaxone and increase azithromycin to 2g. • Give partner notification slip/s with code: SSW. • For pain, give ibuprofen4 400mg 8 hourly with/after food for up to 5 days. • Advise to rest and elevate scrotum. • Review after 7 days or earlier if needed: if no better, refer.",
   "bbox": [
    245.6,
    420.5,
    460.2,
    521.5
