   "text": "If unable to retract foreskin, refer. Pain with/without swelling or discharge Treat for male urethritis syndrome (MUS): • Give single dose ceftriaxone 250mg IM1 and single dose azithromycin 1g. • If severe penicillin allergy2, omit ceftriaxone and increase azithromycin to 2g. • If partner has vaginal discharge syndrome (VDS), add single dose metronidazole3 2g. • Give partner notification slip/s with code: MUS.",
